Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.29,0:01:34.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,This is unexpected.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.58,0:01:46.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,I thought it'd be long dead by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.13,0:01:55.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Looks like you screwed up the "delivery"\Nyou were supposed to make.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.79,0:01:58.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Are you the one\Nwho asked him to deliver this?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.75,0:02:02.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Nah, I'm just a hired hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.54,0:02:04.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you're the one who did that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.92,0:02:07.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that was me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.25,0:02:09.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,I didn't know it was so important.\NI'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.71,0:02:13.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Why are you apologizing to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.29,0:02:17.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,I couldn't care less\Nwho messes up whatever shipment.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.29,0:02:21.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,My business is with that one only.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.38,0:02:26.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm here to bring it back with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.17,0:02:30.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,You mean you came to pick up Rolo?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.17,0:02:35.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's right.\NIt's worth quite a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.17,0:02:39.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Parry!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.79,0:02:44.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Where'd that come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.50,0:02:48.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,You are in my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.67,0:02:54.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,So, you mind handing that one over to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.17,0:02:57.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Are you talking about Rolo?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.33,0:02:59.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,I don't know its name.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.08,0:03:04.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,The one behind you,\Nit's worth some real money.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.08,0:03:05.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Its carcass, I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.33,0:03:11.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,You said his carcass...\NWhat do you mean by that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.17,0:03:15.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,I could bring it back alive\Nand let my client murder it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.50,0:03:17.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,But why go to the trouble?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.29,0:03:21.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm doing them a favor, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.17,0:03:23.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,I really don't understand\Nwhat you're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.21,0:03:26.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,You don't have to understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.63,0:03:30.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Parry!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.58,0:03:34.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,What is happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.42,0:03:38.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Both Instructor and that mysterious man\Nare moving so fast I can't see a thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.71,0:03:42.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Lady Lynneburg,\Nmake sure you don't leave my side.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.79,0:03:46.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're... a weird one, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.08,0:03:49.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Parry!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.71,0:04:01.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,You are in my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.25,0:04:06.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'll start by just lopping your head\Nright off, I suppose.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.92,0:04:12.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Parry!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.96,0:04:29.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,This is unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.83,0:04:32.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Just one strike with that tiny blade...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.00,0:04:33.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's ridiculously strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.88,0:04:36.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Like that cow I fought before.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.46,0:04:38.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,No, it's even stronger than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.42,0:04:45.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,How weird...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.25,0:04:50.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Parry!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.38,0:04:54.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,This is bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.67,0:04:56.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,All I can do is avoid\Nhis attacks on intuition alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.29,0:05:01.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Fighting him while protecting Rolo\Nis going to run me down eventually.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.42,0:05:04.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Why... won't you die?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.67,0:05:09.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,That intensity is unreal...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.75,0:05:11.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,I can't get any closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.29,0:05:16.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ines!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.29,0:05:18.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,This situation is dangerous,\Nso please stand a little further back.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.79,0:05:20.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,If we carelessly get too close\Nwe'll be swept up in this skirmish.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.79,0:05:25.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,There's no mistaking\Nthat bizarre appearance.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.71,0:05:27.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,That is the Deadman.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.75,0:05:28.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,The Deadman?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.50,0:05:33.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,The former S-rank adventurer,\NDeadman Zadu.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.54,0:05:35.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Deadman Zadu...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.58,0:05:41.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ah, yes, I agree!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.29,0:05:42.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,That would be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.38,0:05:44.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Pardon me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.04,0:05:46.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ines?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.21,0:05:48.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,I thought you were\Nhelping out the guards.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.25,0:05:51.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,I found this while I was doing so.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.04,0:05:53.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,They're documents from an unsolved case.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.33,0:05:56.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,"Intended target is dead."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.54,0:05:58.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's what it says,\Nso why do we still act as if it's ongoing?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.75,0:06:02.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, that one is done and over with.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.13,0:06:04.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Officially, the target is already dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.79,0:06:05.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Officially?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.96,0:06:08.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Deadman Zadu.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.04,0:06:10.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,He became an S-rank adventurer\Nat a young age,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.79,0:06:13.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,and then became a target for S-ranks.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.38,0:06:17.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,An S-rank target that's human?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.38,0:06:18.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sounds like fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.96,0:06:21.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'll go put a guy like him down for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.75,0:06:22.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.17,0:06:25.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,I would recommend not fighting him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.38,0:06:27.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's a smart move.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.13,0:06:29.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.17,0:06:31.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,He's so bad he scares\Nthe instructors, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.83,0:06:33.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Let me see those.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.17,0:06:34.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Absolutely not.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.38,0:06:38.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's more like Zadu\Nis too strong for anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.21,0:06:40.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,We don't want to send\Nmore people just to get killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.58,0:06:41.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Precisely.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.63,0:06:45.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,I fail to see any benefit in us\Ngoing to battle with him right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.33,0:06:48.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Are you curious?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.92,0:06:50.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.63,0:06:56.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,As a kid, he mastered the ancient art\Nof Dwarven Alchemy,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.13,0:07:02.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,and at the tender age of 13\Nhe earned the name "Dragon Slayer."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.42,0:07:04.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,At 13?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.00,0:07:05.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,He was more of a prodigy than me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.00,0:07:08.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,His abilities continued\Nto be recognized after that,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.67,0:07:11.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,his reputation spread to foreign lands,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.67,0:07:15.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,and he became the apex\Nof all adventurers.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.08,0:07:20.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Jeez, he sounds like\Nthe perfect fairy tale hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.63,0:07:23.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Why is such a person a target?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.46,0:07:27.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,He did not always use his abundance\Nof talents and techniques
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.54,0:07:29.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,for the right things.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.75,0:07:31.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's just as written there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.92,0:07:36.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,"36 members of a merchant family\Nof Sarenza, all murdered."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.75,0:07:39.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,He really killed ordinary people?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.08,0:07:41.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Some in the guild association
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.63,0:07:45.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,even suggested that he should be\Nstripped of his adventurer's license.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.96,0:07:50.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,However, the contributions he made\Nto the guild were significant.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.54,0:07:54.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,He's also taken down a disaster-level\Nthreat of a monster on his own.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.33,0:07:58.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ultimately, because the opinion\Non how to deal with Zadu was split,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.96,0:08:01.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,that matter was put on hold.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.46,0:08:05.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,That man accepts every single commission,\Nwithout discrimination.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.96,0:08:08.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,As long as it makes him money, that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.67,0:08:14.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,To him, morals, social etiquette,\Nhistory of a nation...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.29,0:08:16.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,they're all meaningless.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.71,0:08:18.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,The best example of this...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.58,0:08:22.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,He wiped out an entire country?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.88,0:08:31.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Just as his client requested,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.46,0:08:34.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,he destroyed the army\Nof a country on his own,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.71,0:08:37.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,and murdered the entire royal family.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.25,0:08:41.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,It was as if he had crushed\Na goblin den.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.33,0:08:44.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Many people noticed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.29,0:08:49.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,It was like he had no concept\Nof good and evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.50,0:08:55.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Zadu has been challenged\Nby multitudes of adventurers
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.54,0:08:57.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,whose goal was the\Nvast bounty on his head...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.96,0:09:00.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,but it only ended in a mountain of\Ncorpses as the amount for the reward
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.21,0:09:01.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,went higher and higher.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.67,0:09:05.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,In order to prevent any more\Nmeaningless casualties,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.88,0:09:08.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,the guild announced publicly\Nthat he was successfully killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.71,0:09:11.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's why he's "Deadman" Zadu...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.08,0:09:12.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ah, damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.58,0:09:16.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Now my collection is basically gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.83,0:09:19.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry that I broke them all,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.13,0:09:21.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,but it's your fault for suddenly\Nattacking us out of nowhere, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.63,0:09:24.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm not expecting an apology.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.21,0:09:26.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,But even so,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.38,0:09:28.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,I can understand mythril,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.08,0:09:32.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,but orichalcum and dragon tusk\Ndon't break that easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.21,0:09:35.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, really?\NDo you want me to reimburse you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.75,0:09:39.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're pretty weird, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.50,0:09:43.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,But what's weirder is that sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.33,0:09:48.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,A weird guy using a weird sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.63,0:09:50.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Well, that's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.25,0:09:52.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'll play it safe today...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.96,0:09:56.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,and use this instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.92,0:10:06.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,That can't be...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.00,0:10:09.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,His one sword breaks apart\Ninto scores of others.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.04,0:10:14.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,And in the blink of an eye,\Nit takes several hundred lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.17,0:10:17.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,A deadly weapon he transmuted\Nby his own hand...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.17,0:10:19.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,The Silver Cross.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.83,0:10:26.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Destroy as many of them as you like,\NI don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.17,0:10:29.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,I can easily make more, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.33,0:10:36.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Destroy as many of them as you like,\NI don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.50,0:10:39.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,I can easily make more, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.00,0:10:40.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Parry!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.17,0:10:44.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Instructor Noor!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.25,0:10:47.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,I knew I couldn't handle all of these!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.79,0:10:49.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Parry!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.83,0:10:53.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,This is bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.92,0:10:56.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,There are far too many Silver Crosses.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.29,0:10:58.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,At this rate, the both of them will die!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.25,0:11:01.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,They need my help!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.96,0:11:04.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,I must compose myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.83,0:11:09.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,My mission is to make sure Lady Lynneburg\Nmakes it safely into exile.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.67,0:11:12.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,I have to calmly determine my priorities.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.92,0:11:16.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,The first thing I should do is...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.96,0:11:20.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Lady Lynneburg.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.04,0:11:25.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,May I have your permission\Nto leave you and assist in the battle?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.54,0:11:27.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Let's do that again!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.75,0:11:28.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Parry!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.25,0:11:30.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Parry!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.88,0:11:33.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Countering that is the best I can manage.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.96,0:11:35.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm too late for those!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.54,0:11:36.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Divine Shield!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.96,0:11:39.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.71,0:11:40.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Parry!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.75,0:11:52.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,My duty is to protect Lady Lynneburg\Nat all costs.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.21,0:11:55.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,That is precisely why...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.71,0:12:01.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,I will not let this man die.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.50,0:12:03.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,My apologies, but I'm finally here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.88,0:12:06.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ines... You're a lifesaver.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.58,0:12:08.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Divine Shield!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.79,0:12:15.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,That shield of light is just like a sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.92,0:12:18.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,But it doesn't seem like any will hit him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.00,0:12:22.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Even his silver blades\Nare slipping through her attacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.13,0:12:27.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sir Noor.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.13,0:12:30.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,This situation won't change\Nif we continue fighting like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.17,0:12:33.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'll focus on defense for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.54,0:12:36.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but can you take him out?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.42,0:12:41.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,A swarm of blades flying around\Nlike a living creature...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.46,0:12:45.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Though in the past, I did hit a bird\Nthat was faster than this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.54,0:12:50.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,The fang of that frog...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.38,0:12:51.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Maybe this will work.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.71,0:12:52.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ines.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.67,0:12:53.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Can you do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.13,0:12:57.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.13,0:13:00.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,On my signal, will you remove\Njust the shield that's in front of me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.08,0:13:03.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Are you sure you can do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.00,0:13:05.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Maybe... I can manage, I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.71,0:13:07.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Physical Enhancement.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.96,0:13:09.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.29,0:13:14.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Stone Throw!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.96,0:13:19.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,The Silver Crosses are shattering.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.00,0:13:23.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Did he throw the Black Death Dragon's\Nnails and fangs?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.00,0:13:27.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,I've got plenty of ammo,\Nso I'll just keep throwing them!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.58,0:13:28.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.38,0:13:32.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Stone Throw!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.29,0:13:36.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Instructor Noor...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.00,0:13:38.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,I've taken out quite a few.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.63,0:13:40.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Just a little more...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.67,0:13:45.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Parry!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.83,0:13:53.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,That was a close one.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.17,0:13:54.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,You almost startled me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.63,0:13:56.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Right back at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.75,0:13:59.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,How did you block that one?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.54,0:14:08.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Also, this one's adamantite,\Nso how did you break it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.29,0:14:12.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sorry about that,\Nbut you were coming in for an attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.71,0:14:15.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Like I said, I don't need an apology.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.25,0:14:18.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,But I have to make up for\Nwhat I've lost, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.08,0:14:20.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Parry!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.96,0:14:23.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Could you please stop\Nwith the surprise attacks?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.42,0:14:27.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,That sword sure is weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.58,0:14:29.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,I mean, so are you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.04,0:14:34.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,How have you been able to see\Nmy attacks and then use it to counter?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.50,0:14:36.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Uhh... I just kinda do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.71,0:14:40.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,I feel like there must be\Nmore to it than that...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.00,0:14:42.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Are you gonna do it again?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.58,0:14:43.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Nah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.00,0:14:45.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's a pain in the ass to recover mythril
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.92,0:14:48.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,after it gets shattered\Nall over the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.08,0:14:50.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm closing up shop for the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.38,0:14:53.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Then you're leaving now, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.58,0:14:54.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.54,0:14:57.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,I heard there's about to be a flashy\N"celebration" in the royal capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.88,0:15:00.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,But it seems like I should probably\Ngive up going to that too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.21,0:15:04.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,What do you mean,\Nthere's a celebration in the capital?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.42,0:15:09.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,I don't know the details either,\Nbut seems like it'll be real extravagant.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.71,0:15:13.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Now then, I've had enough fun,\Nso I guess I'll just pack it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.63,0:15:16.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,See ya, weirdo.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.13,0:15:18.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okay, bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.71,0:15:24.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're... really pretty strange,\Naren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.08,0:15:28.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Am I? I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.38,0:15:33.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,I've seen a lot of strange people\Nup 'til now,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.21,0:15:36.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,but even among all of them,\Nyou're exceptionally screwy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.79,0:15:40.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Consider yourself lucky, demonfolk.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.63,0:15:44.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'd have made good money\Nbringing you back with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.38,0:15:46.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,What a waste.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.25,0:15:49.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,However...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.00,0:15:49.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Parry!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.88,0:15:52.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Can you please give it a rest?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.21,0:15:58.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Can't do anything with this guy here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.58,0:16:12.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,An extravagant celebration\Nin the royal capital?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.71,0:16:14.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Is that what that man said?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.75,0:16:15.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.13,0:16:19.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Are you two interested?\NSounds like quite the party.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.83,0:16:21.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,I am curious.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.17,0:16:22.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,I wonder what's happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.83,0:16:23.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.83,0:16:25.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,In that case, how about\Nwe go back for a little while?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.96,0:16:26.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.42,0:16:30.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,We're really not that far from the city,\Nyou know?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.96,0:16:33.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Besides, we can't take Rolo to Mithra,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.42,0:16:35.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,but there's not much of a problem\Nif we go to the capital, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.75,0:16:38.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,But, Sir Noor, I'm not sure-
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.04,0:16:38.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,We can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.83,0:16:43.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,What's wrong? Are you cold, Rolo?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.29,0:16:44.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,You don't look too good.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.83,0:16:48.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Y-you're all... from the royal capital?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.58,0:16:49.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.92,0:16:52.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,It seems that we can't all go\Non our journey together,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.00,0:16:54.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,so I thought it'd be\Na good idea to go back temporarily.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.33,0:16:55.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,You don't want to?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.96,0:16:58.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,No... that isn't it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.50,0:17:01.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,You can't go back... You just can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.13,0:17:04.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.54,0:17:05.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,I heard something.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.50,0:17:09.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,The biggest one\Nis going to the royal capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.92,0:17:12.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,And it's strong enough\Nto wipe out the entire city.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.63,0:17:16.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's what I heard them say.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.88,0:17:20.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,They said the Black Death Dragon\Nwill pale in comparison to this show!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.38,0:17:24.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,What does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.29,0:17:32.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ines, let's go back to the capital\Nright now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.13,0:17:34.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,The situation appears to be\Nmore urgent than I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.04,0:17:37.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Instructor, are you all right with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.58,0:17:39.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yes, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.79,0:17:40.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Please, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.46,0:17:43.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,I cannot agree to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.54,0:17:45.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Lord Rein told me-
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.13,0:17:46.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.04,0:17:49.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,He told you that if\Nanything happens in the capital,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.04,0:17:51.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,to escape with me to Mithra.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.46,0:17:53.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's what he told you to do, correct?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.67,0:17:55.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,How do you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.67,0:17:57.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Because I'm his little sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.50,0:18:00.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,I know that's how my brother thinks.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.92,0:18:04.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,But what do you think will happen\Nif I'm the only one who runs away?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.58,0:18:06.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,We should head there\Nimmediately and tell them!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.79,0:18:08.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,They must know of the\Nimpending danger the capital is in.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.83,0:18:09.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.92,0:18:14.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,You know the story of the demonfolk and\Nhow they've lost their homeland, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.79,0:18:17.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Even if we try to escape now,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.54,0:18:20.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,we will surely suffer\Nthe same fate as them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.96,0:18:25.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,As you wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.75,0:18:28.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Let's return to the royal capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.67,0:18:30.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,But, Lady Lynneburg...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.38,0:18:33.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Do not under any circumstances\Nleave my side.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.88,0:18:36.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Ines.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.00,0:18:39.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Rolo, what will you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.33,0:18:43.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,If you don't want to come with us,\Nit's probably best if we split up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.21,0:18:48.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'll go too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.13,0:18:52.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,I may not be able to do anything,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.63,0:18:56.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,but whoever is bringing that monster\Nmust be one of us demonfolk.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.13,0:19:00.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, really?\NBeing demonfolk sure is a lot of work.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.13,0:19:10.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm sure this boy's upbringing\Nhas pained Instructor.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.33,0:19:13.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,He's such a big-hearted person.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.29,0:19:16.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,At least, compared to me...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.21,0:19:19.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,I wish...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.46,0:19:21.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,I could've had a bite...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.38,0:19:23.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,of that poison frog.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.21,0:19:32.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Honestly, it'd be a lie\Nto say I'm not worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.08,0:19:35.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,But if Instructor Noor,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.33,0:19:37.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,who fought off both\Nthat Black Death Dragon
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.50,0:19:40.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,and that legendary\NDeadman Zadu, is with us,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.21,0:19:41.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,then maybe we'll be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.54,0:19:42.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Rolo, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.96,0:19:45.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,There are some\Nwild horses over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.63,0:19:47.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Uh... yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.17,0:19:53.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Right, as the princess of Clays Kingdom,\Nmy duty is not to run away.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.54,0:19:55.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,I have to bring him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.04,0:19:59.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,This man who jumped\Nstraight out of an epic hero's tale.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.50,0:20:02.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,He must go back to the royal capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.75,0:20:05.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Even if it costs my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.25,0:20:08.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ines, let's go as quickly as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.79,0:20:09.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.00,0:20:23.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Reporting in!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.21,0:20:27.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Just about all citizens in the\Nold city district have been evacuated.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.54,0:20:28.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.33,0:20:31.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,The efforts of the\NSovereign Six have paid off,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.88,0:20:34.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,and we believe they have\Nfended off the enemy's ambush.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.46,0:20:35.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.38,0:20:37.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,But there should still be\Nanother wave coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.33,0:20:40.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,The Secret Corp are conducting\Na desperate search for the enemy,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.58,0:20:42.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,but they've found no sign of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.38,0:20:44.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,No, if they're coming for us,\Nthey'll do it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.88,0:20:46.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Our forces are scattered,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.79,0:20:48.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,they're waiting for us\Nto exhaust ourselves,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.83,0:20:51.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,and they should be setting up\Nfor the next big wave.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.17,0:20:53.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Lord Rein...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.79,0:20:58.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,The problem is we can't at all see\Nwhat that next wave will be.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.29,0:20:59.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Where is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.29,0:21:01.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,To the north?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.33,0:21:03.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,The south?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.46,0:21:05.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Or perhaps...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.42,0:21:07.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,According to the Hunter Corp,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.96,0:21:11.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,there have been no confirmed sightings\Nof flying beasts...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.04,0:21:19.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.17,0:21:22.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,It can't be...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.46,0:21:25.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Is that above the clouds?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.71,0:21:29.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Uncover!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.75,0:21:43.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.50,0:21:44.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,This can't be happening!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.00,0:21:55.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Could it be a Black Dragon?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.33,0:21:56.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,No, it isn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.92,0:21:59.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's far too big.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.04,0:22:00.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's a...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.50,0:22:03.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Dragon of Calamity!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.00,0:22:10.96,Q1,,0,0,0,,#7 I Parry the Deadman
